│    conditions are built dynamically based on the objects in the    │
│    table.                                                          │
│  4 Appending to Queries: The combined query is appended to the     │
│    self.queries list.                                              │
│                                                                    │
│ This patch addresses the core issue by combining delete queries    │
│ for the same table, reducing the number of database roundtrips and │
│ improving performance. It's a significant improvement over the     │
│ original approach, which generated multiple individual queries.    │
